  "title": "Windows Query renumbers a query's expressions on save: those still used keep their order, compacted from 1; new ones are appended",
  "statement": "On each save PSQRYEXPR is renumbered: expressions no criterion uses any more are dropped, the remaining ones keep their relative order from EXPNUM 1, new ones follow, and every criterion's R1CRTEXPNUM / R2CRTEXPNUM is rewritten to match; PSQRYDEFN.EXPCOUNT is the count.",
